        <item>
            <title>v1.0.1</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 15 Jun 2026 07:10:21 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>2</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.6</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <ul>
                    <li>Custom global shortcut is now safe: if you pick a combination another app already owns, your previous working shortcut is kept instead of being lost.</li>
                    <li>&ldquo;Launch at Login&rdquo; now reports failures and always reflects the real state.</li>
                    <li>Fixed a case where reopening the shortcut recorder could swallow keystrokes.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
            <enclosure
